// Requests to test the API from VS Code (REST Client extension)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### GET example from authors endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authors

#### GET by ID example from authors endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authors/1

### GET all posts example from posts endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts

### GET by ID example from posts endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1

### POST example to create a new post
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New Post Title",
  "description": "This is the content of the new post.",
  "category": "category1",
  "authorId": 2
}

### GET example to retrieve all posts by a specific author
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authors/1/posts
